WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.500
I've got a lot of tabs open,
so I check TabPare.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:09.300
Smart Organize has grouped
the related pages for me.

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:13.700
I see a few duplicates here,
so I clean them up.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:18.400
Undo brought the tabs
I closed right back.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:23.600
I put the tabs I'm not using to sleep,
which saves memory.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:29.200
I use this site a lot,
so I've protected it from cleanup.
